      "summary": "Helping Hand for Relief and Development (HHRD) is an international humanitarian organization founded in 1998 that delivers disaster relief, orphan care, and long-term development programs worldwide <cite id=\"2\">Form 990 (2023)</cite>. In FY2024, HHRD managed <cite id=\"2\">$89,337,007 in total revenue</cite>, slightly down from <cite id=\"2\">$94,048,415 in FY2023</cite>. The organization holds <cite id=\"1\">a 100/100 overall score from Charity Navigator</cite> and <cite id=\"1\">meets all 20 BBB Wise Giving Alliance standards</cite>. HHRD operates as a <cite id=\"12\">zakat-eligible charity</cite>, directing resources toward vulnerable populations including orphans, refugees, and individuals with disabilities across multiple regions <cite id=\"9\">Annual Report (2025)</cite>.",
